  "semantics": [
    "A nonempty partial patch may contain only the finite IDs from its group; runtime validates the final tuple.",
    "One opaque revision binds all three fields, including unchanged fields, for 120 seconds.",
    "Sensitive snapshots never include value, persisted_value, effective_value, or secrets in errors.",
    "A successful set confirms persistence, not connection establishment; actual owner application follows delivery acknowledgement.",
    "Pending writes reject another write to the same group. Subsequent get reports applied, rolled_back, or failed.",
    "A failed handover restores the prior tuple only while the journal and complete desired tuple still belong to that operation.",
    "Missing acknowledgement on a live page rolls back after 120 seconds; startup reconciles a still-owned pending journal.",
    "Equal saved values report changed=false. Completion without reconnecting requires matching live-owner evidence; otherwise application is deferred/after_ack with transition pending. Supplied enabled integers must match value and persisted_value."
  ],
